WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.330
Maya wants to know how many cups she sold on sunny days, and the cards are one big mess!

3
00:00:07.795 --> 00:00:11.062
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:11.526 --> 00:00:14.002
This is Episode 79.

5
00:00:14.466 --> 00:00:16.329
Meet the reading lamp.

6
00:00:16.794 --> 00:00:19.955
Maya asks one question: sunny days?

7
00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:22.718
The lamp shines on the pile.

8
00:00:23.182 --> 00:00:25.977
Every sunny card glows and floats up.

9
00:00:26.442 --> 00:00:27.869
Count them.

10
00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:29.583
Done.

11
00:00:30.047 --> 00:00:32.063
The pile never moved.

12
00:00:32.528 --> 00:00:35.818
No sorting, no new shelf, no copying.

13
00:00:36.282 --> 00:00:38.688
Ask, shine, answer.

14
00:00:39.152 --> 00:00:40.791
Another pile?

15
00:00:41.256 --> 00:00:42.990
Shine there too.

16
00:00:43.454 --> 00:00:45.612
That is Amazon Athena.

17
00:00:46.076 --> 00:00:51.087
It asks questions straight to your files where they sit, and you pay only for the question.

18
00:00:51.552 --> 00:00:53.652
Now you know the reading lamp!

19
00:00:54.116 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

